            "review_text": "David H\nHanoi, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nLively local cocktail bar\nDec 2023 • Couples\nIn the same building as the rather lovely Rice Field restaurant (on the first floor). This super lively cocktail and eatery has pumping music and is busy with trendy young locals and a few tourists. Good cocktails and a friendly vibe. Not cheap for Vietnam but worth looking in for post dinner cocktails.\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 19, 2023",
